# C7-BioSync project initialization

Repository: https://github.com/67160162-BUU/C7-earphone
Upstream branch: main
Upstream commit: ad2cbc280a54768f9d588ac6fe5351a70fa81073
Workspace: D:\work\HeadSet

This file is a human-readable initialization record, not an executable.
Agent instructions: AGENTS.md
Project overview and commands: README.md
Implementation map: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
Current state, verification and remaining work: HANDOFF.md
Documentation entry point: docs/README.md
Handoff branch: codex/hardware-demo-handoff (separate from main)

Bootstrap:
  powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/setup.ps1
Run:
  powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/serve.ps1 -Background
Check:
  node scripts/check.mjs
Stop:
  powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/serve.ps1 -Stop

Default URL: http://127.0.0.1:8080/
Default storage: .local/data (ignored by Git)
Local config: .env (ignored by Git); template: .env.example
Required: PHP 8+ with JSON and PDO; Node.js 18+ for checks only.
No Composer, npm install, frontend build or external web assets are needed.
MySQL and ESP32 hardware are optional for the browser simulation.
